    "_postman_id": "cf10c0c3-23c7-48a9-b05e-1ed115c7a543",
    "name": "EMA Proprietary Encounters/Visits API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The EMA Proprietary FHIR API provides programmatic access to ModMed EMA clinical and practice-management data using FHIR R4-style resources under `/fhir/v2`.\n\nThis documentation targets the **public sandbox** (`stage.ema-api.com`).\n\n**Authentication.** Two mechanisms are supported during the current migration: the **legacy OAuth2 `password` grant** (being sunset) and the **new OAuth2 `client_credentials`** flow (recommended for new integrations) — see the **Authentication** guide. Every API call also requires the `x-api-key` header.\n\nContact Support:\n Email: ankit.srivastava@modmed.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
